    "Perch creates a separate Reminders list for today's and upcoming tasks. Standard mirroring imports only today's completion. Experimental two-way sync can also import text, priority, due dates, reopening and deletion for linked tasks. Conflicting edits pause sync rather than choose a winner. Existing reminders and other lists are never adopted. Undo or Redo pauses sync until you turn it off and on again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Perch creates a separate Reminders list for today's and upcoming tasks. Standard mirroring imports only today's completion. Experimental two-way sync can also import text, priority, due dates, reopening and deletion for linked tasks. Conflicting edits pause sync rather than choose a winner. Existing reminders and other lists are never adopted. Undo or Redo pauses sync until you turn it off and on again."
          }
        },
        "zz": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "⟦Përch crëàtës à sëpàràtë Rëmïndërs lïst för tödày's ànd üpcömïng tàsks. Stàndàrd mïrrörïng ïmpörts önly tödày's cömplëtïön. Ëxpërïmëntàl twö-wày sync càn àlsö ïmpört tëxt, prïörïty, düë dàtës, rëöpënïng ànd dëlëtïön för lïnkëd tàsks. Cönflïctïng ëdïts pàüsë sync ràthër thàn chöösë à wïnnër. Ëxïstïng rëmïndërs ànd öthër lïsts àrë nëvër àdöptëd. Ündö ör Rëdö pàüsës sync üntïl yöü türn ït öff ànd ön àgàïn. ·~⟧"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Perch follows the app language for dates, numbers and interface text. Natural-language task entry supports English; other languages never fall back to English or rewrite tasks.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Perch follows the app language for dates, numbers and interface text. Natural-language task entry supports English; other languages never fall back to English or rewrite tasks."
          }
        },
        "zz": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "⟦Përch föllöws thë àpp làngüàgë för dàtës, nümbërs ànd ïntërfàcë tëxt. Nàtüràl-làngüàgë tàsk ëntry süppörts Ënglïsh; öthër làngüàgës nëvër fàll bàck tö Ënglïsh ör rëwrïtë tàsks. ·~⟧"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Perch has no Reminders permission. Grant it under System Settings › Privacy & Security › Reminders.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
