          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Planner data needs recovery. Kept %lld valid record(s) in a read-only draft. Quarantined %lld invalid record(s) and %lld invalid field(s). Valid records are available read-only; changes cannot be saved. The original planner is unchanged. An exact copy, including malformed records, is at %@. A separate valid-record draft is at %@; rejected locations are listed at %@. Quit Perch and repair the original using those files, or explicitly restore a known-good backup. Do not replace the original with the draft unless you accept omitting the rejected records.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Planner data needs recovery. Kept %lld valid record(s) in a read-only draft. Quarantined %lld invalid record(s) and %lld invalid field(s). Valid records are available read-only; changes cannot be saved. The original planner is unchanged. An exact copy, including malformed records, is at %@. A separate valid-record draft is at %@; rejected locations are listed at %@. Quit Perch and repair the original using those files, or explicitly restore a known-good backup. Do not replace the original with the draft unless you accept omitting the rejected records."
          }
        },
        "zz": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "⟦Plànnër dàtà nëëds rëcövëry. Këpt %lld vàlïd rëcörd(s) ïn à rëàd-önly dràft. Qüàràntïnëd %lld ïnvàlïd rëcörd(s) ànd %lld ïnvàlïd fïëld(s). Vàlïd rëcörds àrë àvàïlàblë rëàd-önly; chàngës cànnöt bë sàvëd. Thë örïgïnàl plànnër ïs ünchàngëd. Ån ëxàct cöpy, ïnclüdïng màlförmëd rëcörds, ïs àt %@. Å sëpàràtë vàlïd-rëcörd dràft ïs àt %@; rëjëctëd löcàtïöns àrë lïstëd àt %@. Qüït Përch ànd rëpàïr thë örïgïnàl üsïng thösë fïlës, ör ëxplïcïtly rëstörë à knöwn-gööd bàcküp. Dö nöt rëplàcë thë örïgïnàl wïth thë dràft ünlëss yöü àccëpt ömïttïng thë rëjëctëd rëcörds. ·~⟧"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Planner schema version %lld is not supported by this document reader. Open it with a compatible Perch version. No data was rewritten or restored.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
