    "Two-way sync keeps linked tasks after day rollover. Completion and reopening still require today; historical edits, unsupported alarms and recurrence stop sync. Deleted identities are never recreated automatically.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Two-way sync keeps linked tasks after day rollover. Completion and reopening still require today; historical edits, unsupported alarms and recurrence stop sync. Deleted identities are never recreated automatically."
          }
        },
        "zz": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "⟦Twö-wày sync këëps lïnkëd tàsks àftër dày röllövër. Cömplëtïön ànd rëöpënïng stïll rëqüïrë tödày; hïstörïcàl ëdïts, ünsüppörtëd àlàrms ànd rëcürrëncë stöp sync. Dëlëtëd ïdëntïtïës àrë nëvër rëcrëàtëd àütömàtïcàlly. ·~⟧"
          }
        }
      }
    },
